@startuml uml_ch10_a2a_task_lifecycle_sequence
!include ../common/book-clean.puml
title A2A Task Lifecycle — Sequence

participant "A2A client" as client
participant "A2A server" as server

client -> server : Message
hnote left #lightblue: 1
note right: holds the instruction in one or more\nParts: text, bytes, a file URI, or JSON

activate server
server -> server : performs the task to\na terminal state
hnote left #lightblue: 2

server --> client : Task
hnote left #lightblue: 3
note right: stateful and server-hosted, with a status\nand an Artifact holding the results as Parts
deactivate server

note over client, server
  a short interaction may come back as a
  Message instead of a Task
end note

@enduml
